iness segment. Approximately 61.2% of total revenues in 2003 were generated by or through Sprint and its customers using the Company's portion of Sprint’s nationwide PCS network. This was compared to 57.6% in 2002, and 47.1% of total revenue in 2001. No other customer relationship on a stand-alone basis generates more than 2.5% of the Company’s total revenue for 2003, 2002 and 2001.\n\n## ■ 2003 ANNUAL REPORT\n",
