      },
      "text": "Note 11.  Major Customers",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11210784413456137,
        "y0": 0.8101893940357247,
        "x1": 0.8770847943873187,
        "y1": 0.8229166666666666
      },
      "text": "The Company has one major customer and relationship that is a significant source of revenue.  In 2003, as during the",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11210784413456137,
        "y0": 0.8247353934278392,
        "x1": 0.8873521642747269,
        "y1": 0.8374626660587812
      },
      "text": "past number of years, the Company's relationship with Sprint continued to increase, due to growth in the PCS business",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11210784413456137,
        "y0": 0.8390535706221456,
        "x1": 0.8879703945583768,
        "y1": 0.8517808432530876
      },
      "text": "segment.  Approximately 61.2% of total revenues in 2003 were generated by or through Sprint and its customers using",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11210784413456137,
        "y0": 0.8536033847115256,
        "x1": 0.8863652297873902,
        "y1": 0.8663306573424676
      },
      "text": "the Company's portion of Sprint’s nationwide PCS network.  This was compared to 57.6% in 2002, and 47.1% of total",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11210784413456137,
        "y0": 0.8681493841036402,
        "x1": 0.8750185748330908,
        "y1": 0.8808766567345822
      },
      "text": "revenue in 2001.  No other customer relationship on a stand-alone basis generates more than 2.5% of the Company’s",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
